    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file presigned_download.py, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider for managed object storage. I will use AWS S3 as the provider for this task. The AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) will be used to generate a presigned URL for downloading an object from an S3 bucket. The provider will be identifiable in the code through the import of the Boto3 library and the use of AWS-specific functions and parameters. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
